Sugar Pot was added in '''Beta 36.0''', being one of the cards introducing "target in hand" effects. In this case, it's giving a monster in your hand +1/+1 for 3G while having a body of 2/3. '''Beta 54.0''' gave it +1 cost, but also doubled its effect to give the chosen monster +2/+2.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 2

HP: 3

Cost:

* 3 (Post Beta 36.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 54.0, Current)

Abilities:

* Magic: Give a monster in your hand +1/+1. (Post Beta 36.0)
* Magic: Give a monster in your hand +2/+2. (Post Beta 54.0, Current)

Rarity: White (Common)
